<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zhoushu" book-id="b-zhoushu-041" chapter-id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41" source-id="s-zhoushu-041-zhou41-ws2432538">
  <p id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA">王襃</persName>字<persName id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA">子淵</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。曾祖<persName id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p001:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>，齊侍中、太尉、南昌文憲公。祖<persName id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p001:m0031" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAA">騫</persName>，梁侍中、金紫光祿大夫、南昌安侯。父<persName id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p001:m0050" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA">規</persName>，梁侍中、左民尚書、南昌章侯。</p>
  <p id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">卒於位，時年六十四。子<persName id="c-zhoushu-041-zhou41:p002:m0011" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAA">鼒</persName>嗣。</p>
</text>
